OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry and settled night with mostly
OL,7,Flight winds, although perhaps a little
OL,8,Fbreezier across Orkney later in the
OL,9,Fnight. Mostly cloudy but some clear
OL,10,Fspells possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry day with mostly light
OL,13,Fsoutheasterly winds to start, but
OL,14,Fwinds strengthening through the day.
OL,15,FLargely cloudy but some good sunny
OL,16,Fspells breaking through in the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
