OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with rain spreading
OL,7,Feastwards and gales or severe gales.
OL,8,FMostly dry Thursday with long spells
OL,9,Fof sunshine and winds easing. Dry
OL,10,Fspells Friday with rain later.
